      "value": "Malicious users should be reported via email to moderation@vrchat.com with screenshots, videos and/or output logs included. As a precaution, you can disable \"Skip Go button on load\" in the settings menu and hit \"Return to Home\" while loading to avoid joining worlds you don't intend to.",
