  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-01T00:57:55.911Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There seems to be a new type of crasher that is slowly plaguing VRchat. The crasher is a portal crasher. The way I understand it is a player drops a portal directly onto another players position using the victims IP address. It sends them to that world but for some reason you load a black screen instead of the world. It is not dangerous to your PC but you are not able to block it or stop it using safety settings. Please VRchat team I ask you guys take care of this. I propose a popup on your screen asking if you want to go into the world, instead of it directly transporting you to another world.",
